#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:5 2abd0452eaa04b148ed661560edec2bc
msgid "Sky-Drones SmartAP Power Distribution Board"
msgstr "Sky-Drones SmartAP 电源分配板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:8 40b6ac78d60c40e6b8163c251e9ea84c
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:10
#: a253c6747ac5449c9f9c511b847ca9fd
msgid ""
"`SmartAP PDB <https://sky-drones.com/power/smartap-pdb.html>`__ (Power "
"Distribution Board) is a board which allows transferring the power from the "
"battery to ESCs / Motors and generate power supply for the autopilot and "
"other peripherals with different voltage levels. Also, PDB provides the "
"functionality for battery voltage / current measurements. SmartAP PDB makes "
"high-power lines connections easier and much more reliable."
msgstr ""
"`SmartAP PDB <https://sky-drones.com/power/smartap-pdb.html>`__ "
"（电源分配板）是一种将电池电能分配给 ESC/电机，并为飞控和其他外设提供不同电压等级电源的板卡。同时，PDB "
"还提供电池电压/电流测量功能。SmartAP PDB 使大电流线路的连接更加简便可靠。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:20
#: c1cfe20eb046487181f619aece7408c5
msgid "Specifications"
msgstr "规格"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:22
#: 48b749dd36d54223954e7bdea6f2c5b9
msgid "Size: 65x65 mm, four 3mm mounting holes"
msgstr "尺寸：65x65 mm，四个3mm安装孔"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:23
#: a1b37908a6614c71a15cbfd736568e07
msgid "Input voltage up to 60 Volts (14S)"
msgstr "输入电压最高60V（14S）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:24
#: 0b28236d74b94d82b6911dfdf5db3c9e
msgid ""
"Capability to handle extremenly high currents (peak current up to 400A)"
msgstr "能够承受极高电流（峰值电流高达400A）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:25
#: bc7a06e9d3784783b71c665ea77027df
msgid ""
"Power input from the main battery, possibility to connect up to 4 "
"independent batteries"
msgstr "从主电池供电，可连接多达4个独立电池"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:26
#: 8dc652e8650d465f892e5e48e06c802d
msgid ""
"12 pairs of pads (6 on top, 6 on bottom) for powering up to 12 motors (all "
"possible airframe configurations supported)"
msgstr "12对焊盘（顶部6对，底部6对），为最多12个电机供电（支持所有可能的机架配置）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:27
#: a2ab6f044f514054af35217128e09034
msgid "Integrated voltage and current sensors with L/C filters"
msgstr "集成带有 L/C 滤波器的电压和电流传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:28
#: fd8ed7d5302b4109adea87a883ef3db7
msgid "Precise Hall Effect based current measurements"
msgstr "基于霍尔效应的精确电流测量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:29
#: 86cd31f87d4e4ac491c6869124292846
msgid ""
"Integrated DC-DC converter from 10-60 V input (up to 14S battery) to 5V / 5A"
" output  to power peripherals"
msgstr "集成 DC-DC 转换器，将10-60V输入（最高14S电池）转换为5V/5A输出，用于为外设供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:30
#: 5c41c5c97a254aff929d87e270fe6c6a
msgid ""
"Integrated DC-DC converter from 10-60 V input (up to 14S battery) to 12V / "
"5A output to power peripherals"
msgstr "集成 DC-DC 转换器，将10-60V输入（最高14S电池）转换为12V/5A输出，用于为外设供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:31
#: 1f33628330724e978c8cba7432d263f0
msgid "5V and 12V power output terminals (standard 2.54mm/0.1\" connectors)"
msgstr "5V 和12V 电源输出端子（标准2.54mm/0.1英寸连接器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:32
#: dc116f0fc66e4764a1035c13be0e1996
msgid "Integrated loud electromagnetic sounder (buzzer)"
msgstr "集成大音量电磁蜂鸣器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:33
#: 66cb428be7474163a696c2c4b6b5f8bd
msgid ""
"Power output for the autopilot (both 5V regulated and battery voltage level "
"output)"
msgstr "飞控电源输出（同时提供5V稳压输出和电池电压级别输出）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:34
#: 3e272c17b2244ee38082fe79f19edb9c
msgid "Fully compatible with SmartAP, ArduPilot and PX4 autopilots"
msgstr "完全兼容 SmartAP、ArduPilot 和 PX4 飞控"

