#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:51
#: b9b235f3e03345e9b433b6581d2b6a26
msgid "Pinouts"
msgstr "引脚定义"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:53
#: 21008d79a2f04ee083792e75f274b8a1
msgid ""
"SmartAP Power Distribution Board pinout diagram is shown below. Big pads in "
"the rear side are intended for the main battery connection. Up to four "
"independent batteries can be connected using the thick wires (e.g. 8-10 AWG)"
" to be able to handle high current loads and even more using thinner wires. "
"Both top and bottom, left and right sides have pads for ESCs power supply "
"connection. Therefore, up to 12 ESCs can be connected."
msgstr ""
"SmartAP 电源分配板引脚定义图如下所示。背面的大焊盘用于主电池连接。最多可使用粗线（如8-10 "
"AWG）连接4个独立电池，以承受大电流负载，也可使用更细的线接更多电池。顶部和底部、左侧和右侧均有用于 ESC 电源连接的焊盘，因此最多可连接12个 "
"ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:60
#: 79a8ac13c1ff4b0488ff8ed222822d9f
msgid "Voltage and current sensors"
msgstr "电压和电流传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:62
#: ad1745e9b0d245ffa5e5af1fd6c903ca
msgid ""
"SmartAP PDB has integrated voltage and current sensors. Current sensor is "
"located on the bottom side of the PDB. For correct scale / offset "
"configuration, please, refer to Configuration section."
msgstr "SmartAP PDB 集成了电压和电流传感器。电流传感器位于 PDB 底面。有关正确的比例/偏移配置，请参阅配置部分。"

